"""Unit 33: Tagalog Basic Course, Semester I, Chapter 10, Lesson 2: Lodging and Accommodations.
Original lessons; the scope follows the DLIFLC Tagalog Basic Course (piloting edition, September 2017).
Pictures, audio, partner work and role plays are left out; the book's answer keys are used (misprints noted),
numbers, dates and times are written in words in the spoken lines."""
from dsl_tl import *


def dd(xs, ans, n=3, extra=()):
    out = []
    for x in list(xs) + list(extra):
        if x != ans and x not in out:
            out.append(x)
    return out[:n]


# ------------------------------------------------------------------ 1 receptionist and siblings
_RA = [("Receptionist", "Magandang hapon po. Ano po ang maitutulong ko sa inyo?", "Good afternoon. How can I help you?"), ("Client", "Magpapareserba sana ako ng isang kuwarto.", "I would like to reserve one room."), ("Receptionist", "Kailan po?", "When?"), ("Client", "Mula a-uno ng Enero hanggang a-siyete.", "From the first of January to the seventh."), ("Receptionist", "Para sa ilang tao po?", "For how many people?"), ("Client", "Para lamang sa tatlong tao. Kaming mag-asawa at anak ko. Limang taong gulang lang siya.", "For only three people. My spouse and I and my child. He is only five years old."), ("Receptionist", "Narinig ko na may diskuwento raw kayo para sa mga sundalo?", "I heard that you reportedly have a discount for soldiers?"), ("Client", "Opo. Pati rin sa mga guro. Parehong may sampung porsiyentong diskuwento.", "Yes. Also for teachers. Both have a ten percent discount."), ("Receptionist", "Ang galing naman! Tamang-tama ang promong iyan sa amin. Sundalo ako at guro naman ang asawa ko.", "That’s great! That promo is perfect for us. I am a soldier and my spouse is a teacher."), ("Client", "Opo ma’am. At libre rin po ang anak ninyo. Libre rin po ang almusal at hatid-sundo sa paliparan.", "Yes, ma’am. And your child is free too. Breakfast and the airport pick-up and drop-off are also free.")]
